    {
      "slice": "deterministic-risk-scoring",
      "name": "Deterministic risk scoring and banding",
      "objective": "As a KYC analyst, when a case passes completeness I want the risk score computed mechanically from the risk rating matrix — five weighted factors, a Low/Medium/High band, and a sanctions true-positive override that forces High regardless of the total — so the score is reproducible, never editable by any role, and I can see each factor's input, raw score, weight, and contribution in a score-breakdown view on the case.",
